Ashrim Run Support

Need help with Ashrim Run? We're happy to assist.

Contact Support

For questions, technical issues, account assistance, privacy requests, or feedback, contact:

Email: llcsfo@gmail.com

When reporting a technical issue, please include:

A short description of the problem

Whether you are using the iPhone app or Apple Watch app

Your iPhone and/or Apple Watch model

Your iOS or watchOS version

The steps that caused the issue

Please do not send passwords, Sign in with Apple credentials, Health data, or other sensitive information by email.

Account and Data Requests

For help with account access, account deletion, or privacy-related requests, email llcsfo@gmail.com.

Ashrim Run also provides account deletion from within the app where available:

Profile → Account → Permanently Delete Account

Apple Health and Apple Watch

If you experience issues with Apple Health permissions, workout import/export, Apple Watch recording, or synchronization between your Watch and iPhone, contact us at llcsfo@gmail.com.

Response

We will make a reasonable effort to respond to support requests as soon as possible.

